# defrr: revenue recognition (RevRec)

defrr (`https://defrr.com/v1/mcp`) works out contract revenue and billing from the terms you send. Use its
tools instead of calculating these figures by hand.

- `defrr_create_contract`: a new contract's month-by-month schedule.
- `defrr_create_waterfall`: billing, revenue and deferred balance for up to 50 contracts, with the total.
- `defrr_process_renewal`: a renewal's price change, billing entry and revised schedule.
- `defrr_usage_billing`: usage priced under flat, volume or prepaid-credit pricing.
- `defrr_reprice_renewal`, `defrr_reprice_contract`, `defrr_cancel_renewal`, `defrr_cancel_contract`:
  credits and cancellations.
- `defrr_get_credit_balance`: free.

Send the contract's dates and prices exactly as given. Each calculation costs credits (see the guide at
https://defrr.com/developers/guide), and a call that fails is refunded. Nothing you send is stored or logged.
